tess (0.7.0~alpha.14-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add hyperlink support as well as detection of http and https URLs.
  * Define $COLORTERM, $TERM_PROGRAM and $TERM_PROGRAM_VERSION for
    compatibility.
  * Add the ability to define an initial shell title.
  * Rename 'MAJ' to 'SHIFT' in shortcuts for consistency.

